@startuml UserProfile_ComponentDiagram
!theme blueprint
title User Profile - Component/Service/Model Dependencies (Angular)

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

component "UserProfileComponent\n(profile + bet history UI)" as UserProfileComponent

component "ProfileService" as ProfileService
component "RaceService" as RaceService
component "BetService" as BetService

collections "profile.models.ts (DTOs)" as ProfileModels

collections "bet history view models" as BetHistoryView
database "UI State\n(page, pageSize,\nprofile, betHistory,\nisLoading/hasError)" as UIState

UserProfileComponent --> ProfileService : calls getProfileAndBets(page,pageSize)
UserProfileComponent --> RaceService : calls getRaceDetails(bet.raceId) for enrichment
UserProfileComponent --> BetService : calls cancelBet(betId) on Pending

UserProfileComponent --> ProfileModels : uses UserProfileDto,\nBetHistoryResponseDto,\nBetHistoryDto

UserProfileComponent --> BetHistoryView : reads bets[] and maps UI fields

UserProfileComponent --> UIState : stores profile + betHistory\npagination + flags

@enduml
